@startuml sequence-stage-run
' Current Rust card-stage lifecycle. Physical verdict remains with Sean.
title One reviewed card stage - preview is not permission to burn
skinparam backgroundColor #fff/aaf
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #fff/aaf
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #fff/aaf
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #fff/aaf
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Sean Donnellan" as Sean
participant Browser
participant "app\nRust API" as App
participant "compose" as Compose
participant "laser::Machine" as Machine
participant "k6 driver" as Driver
participant "Wainlux K6" as Device
database "runs.jsonl" as Log

Sean -> Browser: Review proposed card
Browser -> App: POST /api/jobs/review
App -> Compose: Validate and compose stages
Compose --> App: Exact 1-bit rasters + layout
App --> Browser: review_id, per-stage PNG/SVG
note over Sean,App
  Submission composes a review only.
  No serial access or motion yet.
end note

Sean -> Browser: Choose stage and confirm placement
Browser -> App: POST /api/plan (review_id, stage)
App -> App: Check current review, prior verdicts,\nmode and back-side flip confirmation
App --> Browser: Fixed goal; no motion
Sean -> Browser: Explicitly start
Browser -> App: POST /api/run
App -> Machine: Run retained raster; report progress
Machine -> Driver: burn(band, progress callback)
loop Each nonblank band
  Driver -> Device: FRAMING, JOB_HEADER, CONNECT, DATA chunks, INITs
  Device --> Driver: ACKs, activity and status frames
  Driver --> App: band-local progress + timings
  Browser -> App: GET /api/state
  App --> Browser: phase, band, percent, timing
  alt Device reports 100%
    Driver --> Machine: reported completion
  else 90 seconds of silence
    Driver --> Machine: assumed completion
    note right of Driver
      Interim policy, not proof
      of physical rest.
    end note
  end
end
Machine --> App: Software outcome
App -> Log: Append redacted run event
App --> Browser: Outcome + band timings
Sean -> Browser: Inspect physical result
Browser -> App: POST /api/verdict
App -> Log: Append independent verdict

note over Sean,Device
  No automatic next-stage run.
  Back side requires accepted prior stage,
  confirmed flip and a separate run request.
  STOP requests cancellation; Sean confirms rest.
end note
footer (C)2026 Sean Donnellan
@enduml
